    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_graph_traits" kindref="compound">GraphTraits</ref> specialization to recursively traverse <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_v_p_block_base" kindref="compound">VPBlockBase</ref> nodes, including traversing through VPRegionBlocks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exit blocks of a region implicitly have their parent region&apos;s successors. This ensures all blocks in a region are visited before any blocks in a successor region when doing a reverse post-order traversal of the graph. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
